  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/logo-banner.png\" alt=\"Mythic Metals\" width=\"1000\" height=\"222\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/owo-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3mlP8IS.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"68\"></a><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iaETp3c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Mythic Metals 是一款關於尋找新礦石、將其冶煉成錠與合金，並打造成你最喜愛的工具與盔甲的 Minecraft 模組。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/ores-and-metals-banner.png\" alt=\"礦石與金屬\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">本模組中的礦石各自分佈於地底的不同區域，甚至在地獄與終界也能找到一些！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/cave-screenshot.png\" alt=\"展示多種礦石的洞穴截圖，包含深板岩與鐘乳石洞穴\" width=\"1000\" height=\"700\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">收集足夠礦石後，你可以透過熔煉、爆炸冶煉，或使用合金鍛造爐將其轉化為精美的金屬或獨特的合金。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/alloy-forgery.png\" alt=\"合金鍛造爐及其介面圖，正在冶煉由粗錳與粗四元礦製成的合金\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/tools-and-armor-banner.png\" alt=\"工具與盔甲\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">比獄髓更強的劍、能瞬間爆破黑曜石牆的鎬，以及隨時間成長的盔甲。這些都是你能用這些金屬打造出的裝備。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/legendary-banglum-screenshot.png\" alt=\"傳奇班格拉姆鎬瞬間挖掘 3x3x9 隧道的圖片\" width=\"500\" height=\"272\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/armor-screenshot.png\" alt=\"穿著普羅米修斯盔甲並手持聖劍的玩家\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals#credits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/credits-banner.png\" alt=\"製作群\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">若沒有眾多人的協助，這個專案將無法實現。感謝所有貢獻者！點擊上方橫幅查看完整的製作群名單。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f69cKvQWScC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/discord-banner.png\" alt=\"Discord 橫幅，副標題為「包含 101% 的痛苦」，引用自某醬料梗\" width=\"400\" height=\"94\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnoaaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_button_stroke.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi 按鈕\" width=\"446\" height=\"70\"></span></a></span></p>",
